WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
Water flows into a tank at 2 litres a minute for 10 minutes.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.690
How much more water?

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.530
Rate × time.

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.280
20 litres.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:14.016
On a rate graph, that's the area underneath.
